  ✓ Inspect send-side lifecycle/backpressure and pipe publication code against libzmq to select the next concrete optimization
  ✓ Implement the selected core/core-tests change and update the execution guide/log documents to match
  ✓ Build, run targeted verification from core/build, and commit/push the completed step if it holds
